Hi,

You may also want to check this paper by my colleagues and myself. I used the 'Matt trick', which quite dramatically improved the convergence (Rhat) and speed of MCMC sampling.

http://journal.frontiersin.org/article/10.3389/fpsyg.2014.00849/abstract

Ahn, W.-Y., Vasilev, G., Lee, S. H., Busemeyer, J. R., Kruschke, J. K., Bechara, A., & Vassileva, J. (2014). Decision-making in stimulant and opiate addicts in protracted abstinence: evidence from computational modeling with pure users.Frontiers in psychology, 5.

Best,
Young

