Subject: Re: modeling A -> B -> C & A -> C relationships in a binomial model using Stan
Message-ID: <z6y0NZGEPAo.jqnpFKnNxX8J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <z6y0NZGEPAo.gQz4xaUcHWgJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <z6y0NZGEPAo.gQz4xaUcHWgJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/z6y0NZGEPAo/m/jqnpFKnNxX8J>
