Hi Lei,

Sorry for the delayed response. As I emailed you, I was out of town.

I used normal priors and the probit function because it was straightforward to use the Matt trick. The specification of the model followed the model of Wetzels et al. (2010) and Steingroever et al. (2013), which are cited in our paper.

Best,
Young

