From u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com  Wed Jun 10 17:07:09 2015
From: u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com (Bob Carpenter)
Date: Wed, 10 Jun 2015 17:07:09 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] simple mixture model puzzle
