If you think of neg-binomial as a mixture of Poissons,
then neg_binomial_2 does the marginalization implicitly,
so you don't have to:

https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Negative_binomial_distribution#Gamma.E2.80.93Poisson_mixture

- Bob

