From uda33143a8db60ce8 at groups.google.com  Sun Jun 28 01:29:29 2015
From: uda33143a8db60ce8 at groups.google.com (Andrew Gelman)
Date: Sun, 28 Jun 2015 01:29:29 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] A poisson model error
Message-ID: <beZSPQ0HHzM.9xxOEqbEurYJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <beZSPQ0HHzM.rOLGtZ8kXzcJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <beZSPQ0HHzM.P3n_7vk4hWIJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <beZSPQ0HHzM.rOLGtZ8kXzcJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
