Subject: Modeling of multimodal data distributions
Message-ID: <Do2XS-kpldQ.evL-GfVq3S0J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/Do2XS-kpldQ/m/evL-GfVq3S0J>
